  "solution": "**LOGIC: (Second Number × 12) - (Second Number - 3) = First Number**\n\n**In 102 ∶ 9 →**\n\n(9 × 12) - (9 - 3) = 108 - 6 = 102\n\nAnd; \n\n**In 146 ∶ 13 →**\n\n(13 × 12) - (13 - 3) = 156 - 10 = 146\n\nSimilarly;\n\n**In 80 ∶ ? →**\n\n(7 × 12) - (7 - 3) = 84 - 4 = **80**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"7\".**",
